$ MCR AUTHORIZE ADD UAFO/UIC=[300,11]/ACCESS=(PRIMARY,9-17)/PRIMEDAYS=(NOSATURDAY)/PWDLIFETIME=30-/PWDMINIMUM=8/EXPIRATION=31-DEC-2030
